  "overview": "**Pencil** is a light-first design system anchored on `#ffffff` canvas surfaces with `#000000` primary ink (21.0:1 contrast) and `#1877f2` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `Figtree` (32px display down to 16px body), unified by `20px` base corner radius and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **Brainly**. Source: published token package, package `brainly-style-guide`. Inventory: **91** colors, **6** typography steps, and **37** documented components (GPL-3.0-only license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 37 component tokens with documented paddings: `0 16px`, `0 20px`, `6px 16px`, `0`, `0 36px 0 16px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#ebf2f7` cards; separate sibling sections using `#dbe4ea` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0 8px 32px 0 rgba(50,60,69,.2)`, `0 2px 8px 0 rgba(50,60,69,.2)`) paired with `#dbe4ea` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#1877f2` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#ffffff` (light) with `#000000` primary text and `#014a82` secondary labels.\n- Use `#1877f2` with `#f7f7f8` text (4.0:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `Figtree` headings with `Figtree` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `20px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (8px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#ebf2f7` surface shifts and `#dbe4ea` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `20px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input` fields and secondary buttons."
}
